The scratch walk and the schema reads must not stall a request:
- read them at most every 10 minutes and keep them between (as storage.rs keeps its sizes), the walk never inside a lock other requests wait on for longer than one read;
- the schema read is one statement over pg_namespace and pg_stat_activity only, on its own connection bounded like `test_database_size` (5 s connecting, 5 s querying), taking no lock beyond catalog reads;
